# The Daretti, Scrap Savant emblem's "whenever an artifact is put into your graveyard from the battlefield" is a
# leaves-the-battlefield ability, so it looks back to the board as it was before the event (CR 603.10a) though the emblem
# is in the command zone (CR 114.4): an artifact creature dying at the same time as Hushbringer doesn't cause it to trigger
# (Hushbringer's rulings). Daretti's game to his -10 emblem, with Bot2's Hushbringer out from turn 2: on turn 11 Bot1 makes
# an Ornithopter and casts Pyroclasm, which kills it and Hushbringer at once; the Ornithopter stays in the graveyard past
# the end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Daretti, Scrap Savant
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Lotus Petal
Island
Ornithopter
Pyroclasm
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Hushbringer
Plains x20

